  <bpmn:process id="Process_0vf1lkj" isExecutable="true">
    <bpmn:documentation>LEGACY DESIGN ARTIFACT (2025 workshop era). Not implemented in Go and never will be in this shape: the availability-check flow was superseded by workflows/100-order-created (ACME_Picking_OrderCreated) and the tour-creation flow by workflows/101-tour-creation (ACME_Picking_TourCreation, route-aware batching). Kept for historical reference only — do not sync against code. Marked legacy in the 2026-06-10 BPMN sync.</bpmn:documentation>
